        "air",
        "arcane"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The air mephit breathes sand and grit in a 15 foot cone that deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> slashing damage to each creature within the area (DC 17 basic Reflex save).</p>\n<p>The air mephit can't use Breath Weapon again for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds.</p>",
